flowchart LR
    Start([Start: Taxpayer Opens Portal]) --> Sess[Initialize Session]
    Sess --> SelectFile[Select PDF/DOCX Document]
    SelectFile --> UploadReq[Upload File via POST /api/upload]
    UploadReq --> ValidateFmt{Valid File Type & Size?}
    ValidateFmt -- No --> ErrFmt[Reject File: Show Error] --> EndFail([End])
    ValidateFmt -- Yes --> CheckText{Has Selectable Text?}
    CheckText -- No --> ErrScanned[Reject: Scanned Image] --> EndFail
    CheckText -- Yes --> SaveDoc[Save Document to DB]
    SaveDoc --> Extract[Regex Primary + NVIDIA NIM Fallback]
    Extract --> DetectForm[Classify Form: ITR-1, 2, 4]
    DetectForm --> SaveExt[Store Extracted JSON]
    SaveExt --> ReviewUI[Display Review Screen]
    ReviewUI --> UserEdit{User modifies fields?}
    UserEdit -- Yes --> UpdateJSON[Update reviewed_json]
    UserEdit -- No --> SelectAY[Confirm AY 2025-26 / 2026-27]
    UpdateJSON --> SelectAY
    SelectAY --> EndOk([Proceed to Tax Calculation])
